#: ../../source/reproduce.rst:2
msgid "Executable Research Hub"
msgstr "可执行研究枢纽"

#: ../../source/reproduce.rst:4
msgid "From published quantum knowledge to executable research infrastructure."
msgstr "从已发表的量子知识到可执行的研究基础设施。"

#: ../../source/reproduce.rst:6
msgid ""
"The `Executable Research Hub <reproduce/index.html>`_ is the literature-"
"to-artifact layer of TensorCircuit-NG's agentic research stack. It "
"collects published quantum computing methods that have been translated "
"into runnable, metadata-rich, and independently inspectable "
"TensorCircuit-NG research artifacts."
msgstr ""
"`可执行研究枢纽 <reproduce/index.html>`_ 是 TensorCircuit-NG "
"智能体研究栈中的文献到产物层。它收集已被转化为可运行、带丰富元数据且可独立检查的 TensorCircuit-NG 研究成果的已发表量子计算方法。"

#: ../../source/reproduce.rst:10
msgid "Open the Reproduce Papers Gallery"
msgstr "打开论文复现画廊"

#: ../../source/reproduce.rst:14
msgid "Explore runnable paper reproductions."
msgstr "探索可运行的论文复现。"

#: ../../source/reproduce.rst:17
msgid "What each artifact contains"
msgstr "每个产物包含什么"

#: ../../source/reproduce.rst:19
msgid ""
"Each entry is organized around a published paper and documents the target"
" figure or result, implementation script, TensorCircuit-NG APIs, backend,"
" hardware requirements, scaling strategy, and generated output. The "
"gallery is designed for inspection and execution: read the paper, inspect"
" the implementation, and run the artifact yourself."
msgstr ""
"每个条目围绕一篇已发表论文组织，记录目标图或结果、实现脚本、所用 TensorCircuit-NG "
"API、后端、硬件需求、扩展策略以及生成的输出。画廊是为检查和执行而设计的：阅读论文、查看实现，并亲自运行该产物。"

#: ../../source/reproduce.rst:21
msgid ""
"These are independent reimplementations rather than author-endorsed "
"replications. Many entries are deliberately scaled down for local "
"execution, and each entry records its simplifications and scope. They "
"should be treated as executable illustrations and benchmark artifacts, "
"not as claims that reproduce every detail of the original study."
msgstr "这些是独立重实现，而非作者认可的复刻。许多条目为便于本地执行而有意缩小规模，每个条目都记录了其简化之处和范围。它们应被视为可执行的示例和基准产物，而不是对原始研究每个细节都能复现的声明。"

#: ../../source/reproduce.rst:24
msgid "How it fits the agentic research stack"
msgstr "它如何融入智能体研究栈"

#: ../../source/reproduce.rst:26
msgid ""
"The Hub represents one stage of the broader TensorCircuit-NG research "
"loop:"
msgstr "该枢纽代表更广泛的 TensorCircuit-NG 研究闭环中的一个阶段："

#: ../../source/reproduce.rst:33
msgid ""
"The `Agentic Quantum Research guide <agentic.html>`_ describes the "
"broader workflows for algorithm discovery, performance optimization, "
"framework translation, code review, and scientific communication."
msgstr "`智能体量子研究指南 <agentic.html>`_ 介绍了算法发现、性能优化、框架转换、代码审查和科学交流等更广泛的工作流。"

#: ../../source/reproduce.rst:36
msgid "Contribute an artifact"
msgstr "贡献一个产物"

#: ../../source/reproduce.rst:38
msgid ""
"To contribute a new entry, choose a paper, follow the conventions in "
"`examples/reproduce_papers <https://github.com/tensorcircuit"
"/tensorcircuit-ng/tree/master/examples/reproduce_papers>`_, document the "
"reproduction strategy in ``meta.yaml``, generate the declared outputs, "
"and open a pull request."
msgstr ""
"要贡献新条目，请选择一篇论文，遵循 `examples/reproduce_papers "
"<https://github.com/tensorcircuit/tensorcircuit-"
"ng/tree/master/examples/reproduce_papers>`_ 中的约定，在 ``meta.yaml`` "
"中记录复现策略，生成声明的输出，并提交 pull request。"

